明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":13889,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊二绝 其一","author":"谢迁","text":"山庄过雨菊含香，十月中旬未著霜。\n天为衰翁留好景，赏心何必定重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":13890,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊二绝 其二","author":"谢迁","text":"呼儿插竹补残篱，篱下经秋菊未衰。\n欲藉晚芳娱老眼，故教重护傲霜枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":13891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨二绝 其一","author":"谢迁","text":"向来井底欲生尘，一雨如今动浃旬。\n烂尽晚禾方种麦，闾阎疾苦向谁陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":13892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨二绝 其二","author":"谢迁","text":"昨朝新霁又沉霪，叵奈泥污巷陌深。\n七八月间愁渴死，当时何苦不为霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":13893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘南山辞禄已久铨曹忽荐之初词甚嘉阅二载陪点三次不果用乃知荐者之虚饰也因赋一绝","author":"谢迁","text":"桃李纷纷足艳阳，春风何意到枯桑。\n萧然白发丈人行，却作少年三伴郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":13894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牙药馈雪湖因寄二绝 其一","author":"谢迁","text":"老来生计只加餐，欲效张仓谅独难。\n馀齿无多愿加爱，莫矜舌在忽衰残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"re